Package: secubox-modem
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         secubox-core (>= 1.0),
         modemmanager,
         libqmi-utils,
         libmbim-utils,
         picocom,
         python3-serial
Recommends: usb-modeswitch,
            usb-modeswitch-data
Description: SecuBox LTE/5G Modem Management
 Quectel LTE/5G modem management interface for SecuBox.
 .
 Features:
  - Auto-detect any plugged Quectel modem (EC25, RM500Q, etc.)
  - Data connection management (APN, connect/disconnect)
  - SMS send/receive via WebUI
  - AT command console (interactive WebSocket terminal)
  - Signal strength monitoring with real-time graphs
  - Firmware/device info display
  - Hybrid approach: ModemManager + qmicli
 .
 Port Debian bookworm de luci-app-modem (SecuBox OpenWrt / CyberMind.fr).
